The error message indicates that Moq does not support verifying extension methods directly. To work around this, we can use a different approach to verify the logging behavior.

One way to do this is to create a custom logger that captures the log messages and then assert on those messages. Here's how you can do it:

<tool>submit_test(csharp)</tool>
